      "worked": "The translated parabola is $y=x^2+h$, with gradient $y'=2x$. At the point of contact its gradient equals the gradient of $y=x$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}2x&=1\\\\x&=\\frac12\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe point also lies on both curves, so\n\n$$\\begin{align*}x^2+h&=x\\\\\\left(\\frac12\\right)^2+h&=\\frac12\\\\h&=\\frac14.\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
